   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "You could reach out to the National Tay-Sachs & Allied Diseases Association, a patient group linked to Canavan disease [E960696e, Ef52c6e0, E08ebf6f, Efd1c057, E4b9f5af, Ebba29d7]. You could also reach out to Canavan Disease Research, another patient group linked to Canavan disease [E6a703de, E2cfdd5c, E51da5ed]. It may be worth asking your child's care team about joining the CanInform natural history study, which is linked to Canavan disease [Ef4a1117, Ebba29d7].",
